      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_91f5aa1059646a87e37237c001287d25461e5860a3365ba97d04bbbad8330e7f"
      ],
      "text": "The course is not tied to a specific language; examples mainly use Python and JavaScript, with some systems languages where appropriate."
    },
    {
