        "slc_e3998590ce3ea906f65f81750a3e12f4cd170786531487389e9acf2c7c85ea48"
      ],
      "text": "The course format includes weekly lectures, hands-on coding sessions, and industry guest talks, with a final project demonstrating modern development practices."
    },
    {
